{"id":55219,"date":"2026-07-28T14:14:19","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T13:14:19","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55219"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:38:00","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:38:00","slug":"corrida-solidariedade-apav","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-solidariedade-apav\/","title":{"rendered":"20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>20\u00aa Corrida de Solidariedade APAV 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na manh\u00e3 de s\u00e1bado, <strong>24 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, no ic\u00f3nico pulm\u00e3o verde da capital portuguesa, o <strong>Parque Florestal de Monsanto<\/strong>, em Lisboa. Promovida pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Apoio \u00e0 V\u00edtima (APAV)<\/strong> com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Xistarca<\/strong>, a corrida comemora duas d\u00e9cadas de uni\u00e3o pelo desporto, pela inclus\u00e3o social e pelo apoio cont\u00ednuo \u00e0s v\u00edtimas de crime.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta instaladas na apraz\u00edvel <strong>Alameda Keil do Amaral<\/strong>, o programa \u00e9 desenhado para todas as gera\u00e7\u00f5es: a <strong>Kids Race de 600m<\/strong> (09h30), a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (10h00) e a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> (10h05). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o garante dorsal personalizado com chip eletr\u00f3nico de cronometragem Xistarca (10km), medalha de finalista alusiva ao 20\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos no percurso e op\u00e7\u00e3o de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial solid\u00e1ria.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">24 de Ou